  "details": "Introduce a feature that records the date and location where you added each friend, as well as the total time you've spent interacting with them in VRChat.\n\nDetails:\n\nWhen a friend is added, log the date and the specific world where the connection was made.\n\nKeep a running tally of the cumulative time spent in the virtual world with each friend.\n\nPurpose:\n\nThis feature aims to enhance users' social experiences in VRChat by providing a record of when and where they met specific friends, along with how much time they've spent together. This can be especially useful for distinguishing between friends you've interacted with extensively and those you've met but haven't engaged with further.",
